    "major": [
      "W1 — lintegral_affine_beta has an incorrect manuscript-proof mapping. candidate/statement-ledger.md:835 labels it 'L:temporal-equilibrium (proof)', while TemporalEquilibrium.lean:109-111 assumes 'u < s', '0 < p', '0 < q' and evaluates the general two-factor affine Beta integral. manuscript/notes/integrated_temporal_equilibrium.tex:56-64 instead assumes '0 < s < 1' and writes 'L(s)=s^r ∫(1-u)^(2r-1)u^(-r)(1-su)^(-r) du'; the additional factor remains essential. The stated general affine identity is not a step presented by that proof. Exact fix: mark this ledger row 'no direct label (auxiliary to the alternative Lean proof)' and move its index entry at candidate/statement-ledger.md:121 to :122.",
